{"id":"n86390-1-11","stage":4,"title":"형편없다 · 糟糕","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86390-1-11-1","ko":"어제 본 영화 어땠어요?","zh":"昨天看的电影怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"본","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영화","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어땠어요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/6a8230ce2b108b7e5ffb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86390-1-11-2","ko":"배우들의 연기는 좋았지만 내용은 정말 형편없던데요.","zh":"演员的演技还行，但剧情实在很糟糕。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"배우들의","meaning":"演员","explanation":"배우：演员；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"배우","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58204","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연기는","meaning":"演技","explanation":"연기：演技；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"연기","audio":"/audio/8b0e2bb594ceb0c31f20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67479","senseId":"1","lemma":"연기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋았지만","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내용은","meaning":"内容","explanation":"내용：内容；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"내용","audio":"/audio/cb0f24046b508710d631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72573","senseId":"3","lemma":"내용","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"형편없던데요.","meaning":"糟糕，很遭，一塌糊涂","explanation":"형편없다：糟糕，很遭，一塌糊涂；던데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"형편없다","audio":"/audio/aaac5e68ea85fa60cb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86390","senseId":"1","lemma":"형편없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"70129359d515b770","term":"배우","zh":"演员","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3","entryId":"58204","definition":"担任电影、话剧或电视剧等中的人物角色进行表演的人。","pronunciation":["배우"]},{"id":"8b0e2bb594ceb0c3","term":"연기","zh":"演技","audio":"/audio/8b0e2bb594ceb0c31f20.mp3","entryId":"67479","definition":"演员根据扮演的角色表现人物、性格、行动等的行为。","pronunciation":["연ː기"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"cb0f24046b508710","term":"내용","zh":"内容","audio":"/audio/cb0f24046b508710d631.mp3","entryId":"72573","definition":"言语、文章、画作、电影等的情节；或指想借此传递的信息。","pronunciation":["내ː용"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"aaac5e68ea85fa60","term":"형편없다","zh":"糟糕，很遭，一塌糊涂","audio":"/audio/aaac5e68ea85fa60cb6d.mp3","entryId":"86390","definition":"结果、状态、内容等非常不好。","pronunciation":["형펴넙따"]}],"audio":"/audio/bd24cf93f011efc45fd5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.51,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86390","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.3367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["昨天看的电影怎么样？","演员的演技还行，但剧情实在很糟糕。","店里的内部装修变了吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["昨天看的电影怎么样？","演员的演技还行，但剧情实在很糟糕。","店里的内部装修变了吧？"],"answer":1}]}
